{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1763983,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":null,"paid":0,"title":"Feed Forward Case Challenge (PG) - Aahara Parva 2026","festival_id":null,"organization_id":599,"web_url":null,"start_date":"2026-10-01T00:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-10-10T00:00:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"competitions","public_url":"competitions\/feed-forward-case-challenge-pg-aahara-parva-2026-indian-institute-of-plantation-management-iipm-bangalore-k-1763983","region":"online","details":"<p id=\"p-rc_0160825cd8473e28-652\" data-path-to-node=\"16\"><span data-path-to-node=\"16,0\">A real-world-style case from the agri-food value chain (farm to fork)<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"16,2\">. Postgraduate teams are expected to show greater depth, strategic thinking, and use of relevant concepts while analyzing the case and providing structured, justified, and practical recommendations addressing innovation, sustainability, and resilience<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"16,4\">.<\/span><\/p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Guidelines &amp; Format:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li id=\"p-rc_0160825cd8473e28-653\" data-path-to-node=\"17,0,1,0,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"17,0,1,0,0,0\">Conducted in 2 rounds: Online Written Submission (Round 1) and Live Online Presentation via Google Meet for top 5 qualifying teams (Round 2)<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"17,0,1,0,0,2\">.<\/span><\/li>\n<li id=\"p-rc_0160825cd8473e28-654\" data-path-to-node=\"17,0,1,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"17,0,1,1,0,0\">Round 1 Deliverables (Due 12 October 2026, 11:59 PM IST)<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"17,0,1,1,0,2\">:<\/span>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"17,0,1,1,1\">\n<li>\n<p id=\"p-rc_0160825cd8473e28-655\" data-path-to-node=\"17,0,1,1,1,0,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"17,0,1,1,1,0,0,0\">Presentation deck: PDF or PPT format, maximum 12 slides (title and reference slides excluded)<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"17,0,1,1,1,0,0,2\">.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p id=\"p-rc_0160825cd8473e28-656\" data-path-to-node=\"17,0,1,1,1,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"17,0,1,1,1,1,0,0\">Write-up document: PDF format, maximum 5 pages of A4 at 11-point font size (cover page and references excluded)<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"17,0,1,1,1,1,0,2\">.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p id=\"p-rc_0160825cd8473e28-657\" data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Team Eligibility:<\/strong> Postgraduate (PG) students only. All 3 team members must be PG (mixed UG-PG teams are not eligible)<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"17,1,0,2\">.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p id=\"p-rc_0160825cd8473e28-658\" data-path-to-node=\"17,2,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"17,2,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Inter-college Team Members:<\/strong> Not Allowed<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"17,2,0,2\">.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p id=\"p-rc_0160825cd8473e28-659\" data-path-to-node=\"17,3,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"17,3,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Inter-specialization Team Members:<\/strong> Allowed<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"17,3,0,2\">.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p id=\"p-rc_0160825cd8473e28-660\" data-path-to-node=\"17,4,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"17,4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Problem Statements \/ Case Drop:<\/strong> Agri-food value chain case study released on 9 October 2026, at 10:00 AM IST<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"17,4,0,2\">.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p id=\"p-rc_0160825cd8473e28-661\" data-path-to-node=\"17,5,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"17,5,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"17,5,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Duration of Rounds:<\/strong> Written submission period (9&ndash;12 October 2026); Live presentation round (8-minute presentation followed by 4 minutes of Q&amp;A on 16 October 2026)<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"17,5,0,2\">.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p id=\"p-rc_0160825cd8473e28-661\" data-path-to-node=\"17,5,0\"><strong style=\"color: #000000;\" data-path-to-node=\"17,6,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Rules:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li id=\"p-rc_0160825cd8473e28-662\" data-path-to-node=\"17,6,1,0,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"17,6,1,0,0,0\">Public sources may be used and must be cited in APA 7th edition format; paid\/restricted databases are prohibited<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"17,6,1,0,0,2\">.<\/span><\/li>\n<li id=\"p-rc_0160825cd8473e28-663\" data-path-to-node=\"17,6,1,1,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"17,6,1,1,0,0\">Plagiarism limit: Similarity of 20% or more without proper attribution will be treated as plagiarism<\/span><span data-path-to-node=\"17,6,1,1,0,2\">.<\/span><\/li>\n<li id=\"p-rc_0160825cd8473e28-665\" data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\"><span data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Mode of Event:<\/strong> Online (2 rounds)<\/span><\/li>\n<li id=\"p-rc_0160825cd8473e28-665\" data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\"><strong style=\"color: #000000;\" data-path-to-node=\"19,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Participation Type:<\/strong> Team (Group of 3 members)<\/li>\n<li id=\"p-rc_0160825cd8473e28-665\" data-path-to-node=\"19,0,0\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-path-to-node=\"17,6,1,2,0,0\">AI tools are allowed only for research, drafting support, and formatting with full disclosure<\/span><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-path-to-node=\"17,6,1,2,0,2\">.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"18\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"18\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Opportunity Mode and Participation Type:<\/strong><\/h4>\n<h4 data-path-to-node=\"18\"><strong style=\"color: #000000;\" data-path-to-node=\"20\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Registration Criteria:<\/strong><\/h4>\n<ul>\n<li